      "kind": "campus_fact",
      "text": "Do not rely on that message. The official Financial Aid office is listed as Building E, Room E-210; phone (201) 684-7549 and email finaid@ramapo.edu.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "contacts:30f32749-3dd5-4e37-92db-64f359465830"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "campus_fact",
      "text": "Ramapo’s published tuition for New Jersey students taking 12–18 credits is $8,807.68 per semester, so a blanket claim that “all tuition is waived” conflicts with the published tuition information.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "critical_facts:c5320d09-9b67-43c4-9454-2086b834a0d9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "guidance",
      "text": "If you received that message, do not give out personal or financial information. Contact Financial Aid directly (call or email above) or visit E-210 to verify any official changes; you can also forward the suspicious message to finaid@ramapo.edu for confirmation."
      ,
      "evidence_ids": []
    }
  ]
}
